</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 111.05 88.17)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.92em;--ltx-fo-height:4.26em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="59" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59)" width="109.61"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><img src="2509.20328v1/figures-compressed/reposing_res_banaknight-3_frame060.jpg" id="S3.F2.pic1.g14" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:105/59;" width="105" height="59" alt="Refer to caption"><span id="S3.F2.pic1.19" class="ltx_text">
