</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#DA2F77;--ltx-fill-color:#DA2F77;--ltx-fg-color:#DA2F77;" color="#DA2F77" fill="#DA2F77" stroke="#DA2F77"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 78.57 L 653.54 78.57 L 653.54 0 L 0 0"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FFFFFF;--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#FFFFFF" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 2.81 66.8)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:13.74em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="190.06"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.F2.pic1.25" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Reasoning<span id="S3.F2.pic1.25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> – robot navigation</span></span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 3.04 4.07)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.92em;--ltx-fo-height:4.26em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="59" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 59)" width="109.61"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><img src="2509.20328v1/figures-compressed/navigation_frame_0001.jpg" id="S3.F2.pic1.g19" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:105/59;" width="105" height="59" alt="Refer to caption"><span id="S3.F2.pic1.26" class="ltx_text">
