<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Qualitative results:
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#1A73E8;">Perception</span>, <span id="A1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#925BCF;">Modeling</span>, <span id="A1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#C440A7;">Manipulation</span>, <span id="A1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#DA2F77;">Reasoning</span></h2>

