Each of the four pairs shows input (left) and generated output (right).
Prompt: <span id="A1.F50.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">“Draw the figure that completes the pattern in the rightmost box. The images in the boxes are static. Do not modify the existing images, only draw in the empty box. Static camera, no zoom, no pan, no dolly.”</span> Success rate: 0.33 for dots, 1.0 for arrows, 0.75 for shrinking circles, 0.83 for growing squares.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
