<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F58.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 58</span>: </span><span id="A1.F58.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Robot navigation<span id="A1.F58.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. Prompt: <span id="A1.F58.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">“The robot drives to the blue area. Static camera perspective, no movement no zoom no scan no pan.”</span> Success rate: 0.58. Image credit: <a href="https://micromelon.com.au/resources/creating-a-maze-unit" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Micromelon Robotics website</a> with permission from Tim Hadwen.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F59" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="A1.F59.fig1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">
<p id="A1.F59.fig1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.F59.fig1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="--ltx-border-color:#000000;padding:0.0pt;"><img src="2509.20328v1/figures-compressed/arc-agi_arc-agi-1a.jpg" id="A1.F59.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/268;" width="476" height="268" alt="Refer to caption"></span></p>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="A1.F59.fig2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center">
<p id="A1.F59.fig2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center"><span id="A1.F59.fig2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle" style="--ltx-border-color:#000000;padding:0.0pt;"><img src="2509.20328v1/figures-compressed/arc-agi_res_arc-agi-1a_frame040.jpg" id="A1.F59.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/268;" width="476" height="268" alt="Refer to caption"></span></p>
