<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A4.F68.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 68</span>: </span><span id="A4.F68.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Eulerian path.<span id="A4.F68.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">. Prompt: <span id="A4.F68.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">“Create a smooth animation where a red pen traces all existing edges in a continuous path without lifting the pen. All edges need to be traced. Do not visit any edge twice and do not lift the pen. No zoom, no pan."</span> Failure: does not trace the edges exactly, traces non-existent edges.</span></span></figcaption>
</figure>
